{"id":"460358","name":"灯芯麦冬瘦肉汤","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/460358/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"灯芯","amount":"8g"},{"name":"麦冬","amount":"20g"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"10g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"1000ml"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"汤料:灯芯、麦冬、枸杞子。","img":"images/460358/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉剁成末。","img":"images/460358/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把肉辅在汤盅最底层，把汤料也倒入。","img":"images/460358/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量的水和一勺盐。","img":"images/460358/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入电压力锅，启动煲汤键。","img":"images/460358/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"太约一个小时，汤煲好了，撒少许鸡精，完成。","img":"images/460358/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品，汤非常清甜好喝。","img":"images/460358/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。灯芯麦冬炖瘦肉汤具有滋阴润燥、清心降火的食疗功效。","img":"images/460358/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炖盅、电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}